{"id":"torrey:amalekites-the","source":"torrey","name":"Amalekites, The","slug":"amalekites-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descent of — Ge 36:12,16.","refs":[["Gen",36,12,36,12],["Gen",36,16,36,16]]},{"text":"Wicked. — 1Sa 15:18.","refs":[["1Sam",15,18,15,18]]},{"text":"Oppressive. — Jdj 10:12.","refs":[["Judg",10,12,10,12]]},{"text":"Warlike and Cruel. — 1Sa 15:33.","refs":[["1Sam",15,33,15,33]]},{"text":"Governed by Kings — 1Sa 15:20,32.","refs":[["1Sam",15,20,15,20],["1Sam",15,32,15,32]]},{"text":"A powerful and influential nation — Nu 24:7.","refs":[["Num",24,7,24,7]]},{"text":"Possessed cities — 1Sa 15:5.","refs":[["1Sam",15,5,15,5]]},{"text":"In the south of Canaan. — Nu 13:29; 1Sa 27:8.","refs":[["Num",13,29,13,29],["1Sam",27,8,27,8]]},{"text":"Extended from Havilah to Shur. — 1Sa 15:7.","refs":[["1Sam",15,7,15,7]]},{"text":"Was the scene of ancient warfare. — Ge 14:7.","refs":[["Gen",14,7,14,7]]},{"text":"Part of the Kenites dwelt amongst — 1Sa 15:6.","refs":[["1Sam",15,6,15,6]]},{"text":"Were the first to oppose Israel — Ex 17:8.","refs":[["Exod",17,8,17,8]]},{"text":"Discomfited at Rephidim through the intercession of Moses — Ex 17:9-13.","refs":[["Exod",17,9,17,13]]},{"text":"Doomed to utter destruction for opposing Israel — Ex 17:14,16; De 25:19.","refs":[["Exod",17,14,17,14],["Exod",17,16,17,16],["Deut",25,19,25,19]]},{"text":"Their utter destruction foretold — Nu 24:20.","refs":[["Num",24,20,24,20]]},{"text":"Presumption of Israel punished by — Nu 14:45.","refs":[["Num",14,45,14,45]]},{"text":"United with Eglon against Israel — Jdj 3:13.","refs":[["Judg",3,13,3,13]]},{"text":"Part of their possessions taken by Ephraim — Jdj 5:14; 12:15.","refs":[["Judg",5,14,5,14],["Judg",12,15,12,15]]},{"text":"With Midian, oppressed Israel — Jdj 6:3-5.","refs":[["Judg",6,3,6,5]]},{"text":"Overcome by Gideon — Jdj 6:33,34; 7:21,22.","refs":[["Judg",6,33,6,33],["Judg",6,34,6,34],["Judg",7,21,7,21],["Judg",7,22,7,22]]},{"text":"Overcame, and delivered Israel. — 1Sa 14:48.","refs":[["1Sam",14,48,14,48]]},{"text":"Commissioned to destroy. — 1Sa 15:1-3.","refs":[["1Sam",15,1,15,3]]},{"text":"Massacred. — 1Sa 15:4-8.","refs":[["1Sam",15,4,15,8]]},{"text":"Condemned for not utterly destroying. — 1Sa 15:9-26; 28:18.","refs":[["1Sam",15,9,15,26],["1Sam",28,18,28,18]]},{"text":"Agag, king of, slain by Samuel — 1Sa 15:32,33.","refs":[["1Sam",15,32,15,32],["1Sam",15,33,15,33]]},{"text":"Invaded by David — 1Sa 27:8,9.","refs":[["1Sam",27,8,27,8],["1Sam",27,9,27,9]]},{"text":"Pillaged and burned Ziklag — 1Sa 30:1,2.","refs":[["1Sam",30,1,30,1],["1Sam",30,2,30,2]]},{"text":"Pursued and slain by David — 1Sa 30:10-20.","refs":[["1Sam",30,10,30,20]]},{"text":"Spoil taken from, consecrated — 2Sa 8:11,12.","refs":[["2Sam",8,11,8,11],["2Sam",8,12,8,12]]},{"text":"Confederated against Israel — Ps 83:7.","refs":[["Ps",83,7,83,7]]},{"text":"Remnant of, completely destroyed during the reign of Hezekiah — 1Ch 4:41-43.","refs":[["1Chr",4,41,4,43]]}],"refCount":45}
